:healthStateName rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                 rdfs:domain :HealthState ;
                 rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                 rdfs:comment "Name of the health state."@en ,
                              "Nom de l'état de santé."@fr ;
                 rdfs:label "healthStateName"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/ontosim-dis#hospitalCapacity
